                        <tr>
                <td bgcolor="#f0f0f0" width="20%" valign="top"><b>Acceptance Criteria:</b></td>
                <td id="customfield_11018-1109549-value" class="value" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="80%">      <p><b>Acceptance Criteria:</b></p>

<ul>
	<li>Given an XML File has status <tt>Awaiting Approval</tt> and Process Path is ADP (1)
	<ul>
		<li>Then:<a href="https://accelins.atlassian.net/wiki/x/KQARsw" title="smart-link" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://accelins.atlassian.net/wiki/x/KQARsw</a>
		<ul>
			<li>XML file dimensions are validated against dynamics master financial dimensions.</li>
			<li>If all dimensions pass validations record status is updated to Approved else, dimension validation error is displayed and record approval is not updated.</li>
			<li>XML File is Approved and status <tt>Ready to Ship to Dynamics</tt></li>
		</ul>
		</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
</ul>

  </td>
            </tr>
