    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Summary:</b> As an operations user, I want to approve or reject files based on ODS vs XML totals so that only valid files are submitted to D365.</p>

<p><b>Description:</b></p>

<p>Power Platform must provide a UI to compare source and XML totals per file and allow an Approve/Reject decision that updates the Integration File status.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <br/>

    <table cellpadding="2" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" align="center">
    <tr>
        <td bgcolor="#bbbbbb" width="1%" nowrap align="center">
            &nbsp;<font color="#ffffff"><b>Comments</b></font>&nbsp;
        </td>
        <td>&nbsp;</td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="grid" style="margin: 0;">
                <tr id="comment-header-2668583"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="712020:eb641cde-faad-4e60-b1f9-573434c3896c"
                id="word_commented_712020:eb641cde-faad-4e60-b1f9-573434c3896c"
                href="https://accelins.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3Aeb641cde-faad-4e60-b1f9-573434c3896c">
                    Anastasija Lukjancenko
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">24/Mar/26</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-2668583"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p><a href="https://accelins.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A6ba62a51-b97b-4865-ab4f-9d97e28c5270" class="user-hover" rel="712020:6ba62a51-b97b-4865-ab4f-9d97e28c5270" data-account-id="712020:6ba62a51-b97b-4865-ab4f-9d97e28c5270" accountid="712020:6ba62a51-b97b-4865-ab4f-9d97e28c5270" rel="noreferrer">Anchal Kumar</a>  Change in Acceptance criteria as per architecture decision.</p>

<p>This is no longer valid from user story point of view:</p>



<ul>
	<li>When an operations user opens it in the UI</li>
	<li>Then they can clearly see ADP and XML values for:
	<ul>
		<li>Currency</li>
		<li>Total Premium</li>
		<li>Total Tax</li>
		<li>Total Other Contributions</li>
		<li>Total Agency Commission</li>
		<li>Total Commission Amount</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
</ul>


<ul>
	<li>Given the user finds an issue in the comparison
	<ul>
		<li>When they select <b>Reject</b> and optionally provide a reason</li>
		<li>Then:
		<ul>
			<li>Status is updated to <tt>Rejected</tt></li>
		</ul>
		</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li>Given the user is satisfied with the comparison
	<ul>
		<li>When they select <b>Approve</b></li>
	</ul>
	</li>
</ul>

        </td></tr>
